# Seats by plan

Four parts of one whole, and the question is "roughly what share" rather
than "which is larger by how much". Above six slices this would be a
horizontal bar chart instead.

```mdv pie
title: Seats by plan
category: plan
value: seats
format: table
---
plan       | seats
Enterprise |  4820
Business   |  3190
Team       |  1240
Free       |   870
```
